      "kind": "main",
      "family": "figure",
      "number": 2,
      "nickname": "Response structure and variation",
      "canvas": "canvas-1",
      "caption": "Complementary views of response structure. Original exploratory summaries of the same public source collection. **a**, Shared response structure. **b**, Responses through time. **c**, Response variation by temporal frequency. **d**, Dimensions of population activity."
